# An image path pasted into the composer is its badge before Enter, with no
# notice; a path typed into a prompt is attached as the prompt is sent, its
# comma kept after the badge. Then a paste whose path names no file is the
# words it is.
models models-image.json
gateway image-turns.json
work image-ws
wait 3
paste shot.png describe this too
wait 1.5
snap pasted
key Enter
wait 4
snap pasted-sent
type inspect shot.png,
wait 1
snap typed
key Enter
wait 4
snap typed-sent
paste see nope.png and notes.txt
wait 1.5
snap pasted-missing
gwlog
